  "text": "## Red Flags: What to Look For  \n### Transaction Patterns  \n**High-Risk Patterns:**\n- Multiple large deposits followed by immediate large withdrawals\n- Frequent transfers to multiple accounts/jurisdictions\n- Round-number transactions (£10k, £20k exactly)\n- Transfers to high-risk countries\n- Transactions inconsistent with customer profile  \n**Example:** A pensioner suddenly transferring £50,000 to a shell company in Panama",
